msgstr "GPIO 引脚编号、板卡引脚名称及继电器是否已预配置的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:122 f2dffebcd6ba4fbd99b69de5b9287ba3
msgid ""
"its good practice to have the boot block and initial state of the power "
"switch to be OFF."
msgstr "建议将启动块和电源开关初始状态设置为关闭（OFF）。"

