"*The {autopilot name here} has a built-in compass. Due to potential "
"interference, the autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as "
"part of a GPS/Compass combination.*"
msgstr "*{此处填写飞控名称} 具有内置罗盘。由于潜在干扰，通常将其与外部 I2C 罗盘配合使用，作为 GPS/罗盘组合的一部分。*"

